    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d753">

                <pb facs="0613" n="497" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg497"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/23427.</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-05-06">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 6, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: We have the honor to inform your
                    excellency that we have just received two telegrams from the Minister for
                    Foreign Affairs of General Huerta informing us that the landing of troops and
                    munitions of war is being made by the United States in Vera Cruz, and indicating
                    to us that these acts are contrary to the agreement adopted by both Governments
                    at the suggestion of the undersigned for the suspension of hostilities and of
                    military movements between both parties during the process of mediation.</p>
                <p>We feel sure that the acts complained of by the Government of General Huerta will
                    be made the subject of an immediate investigation on the part of your excellency
                    and, if found to be as alleged, will merit the formal adoption of appropriate
                    measures.</p>
                <p>We await a reply of your excellency, at the earliest possible moment, such as
                    will enable us to clarify the situation and to reply in a satisfactory manner to
                    the telegraphic despatches referred to.</p>
                <p>We renew [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <list>
                            <item>
                                <hi rendition="#small-caps">D. da Gama</hi>.</item>
                            <item>
                                <hi rendition="#small-caps">R. S. Naón</hi>.</item>
                            <item>
                                <hi rendition="#small-caps">Edo Suarez Mujica</hi>.</item>
                        </list>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
